/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig
# GF compiler build artifacts (rust/crates/hc-realize/gf/ — gen_templates.py / gf --make output).
*.gfo
# .NET build artifacts for the dotnet-harness project (not Rust, but shares this repo).
dotnet-harness/**/obj/
dotnet-harness/**/bin/
# Corpus/golden artifacts produced by the parity harness stay untracked (see rust-conversion.md §8).
/parity-out/
*.tsv
# ...but conformance fixtures' oracle-generated expectations are tests, not scratch — keep them tracked.
!/conformance/**/expected.tsv
# ...same reasoning for the F7 toy-grammar gate's real C# oracle dumps (fst-candidates/fst-batch,
# chain-off and --chain): tiny, hand-verified, essential to the gate -- not the large corpus goldens
# under /parity-out/ that get regenerated locally per rust-conversion.md §8.
!/crates/hc-hybrid/tests/fixtures/fst-advisor-toys/*.tsv
